{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887410/extras/066e9d2be8249d4386772b7c5acb7bbb.avif?t=1753386525\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Summit Drive a game by Luke Kim</strong>\u00a0is a driving game where you play as an anthropomorphic bird who must make their way up to the mountain summit for a view like none other. It blends the mechanical absurdity of Enviro-bear 2000\u2019s controls with A Short Hike\u2019s cozy, quirky aesthetic. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>About the Demo</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contains a smaller version of the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focuses heavily on the controls.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887410/extras/1fcf2c8efdd97b0b0441a1a326406cf3.poster.avif?t=1753386525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887410/extras/1fcf2c8efdd97b0b0441a1a326406cf3.webm?t=1753386525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887410/extras/1fcf2c8efdd97b0b0441a1a326406cf3.mp4?t=1753386525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steer a physics-based vehicle using only your mouse buttons for directional control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You must use your left mouse to interact, drive, and steer, while using your right mouse button to brake and change gears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887410/extras/df9723dc57ecc067553c5864a84b0272.poster.avif?t=1753386525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887410/extras/df9723dc57ecc067553c5864a84b0272.webm?t=1753386525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887410/extras/df9723dc57ecc067553c5864a84b0272.mp4?t=1753386525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The path upwards is narrow, steep, bumpy, and filled with obstacles that appear before your eyes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game explores the fear of driving and falling, blending them into a metaphor for life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lose all of your progress again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music is great! You will love the music...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887410?t=1753386525","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887410/5aee6169a8766a98484bda9e12dbb55f4beb7d7b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753386525","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887410/7050cb5284e4b9fb85ccd9f27a86b6179c67cd32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753386525","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887410/7050cb5284e4b9fb85ccd9f27a86b6179c67cd32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753386525","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_